+A text-only selection accepts typed or pasted text and transcript quotes. The composer keeps existing attachments and references removable and explains how to send again. File intake refuses before creating an upload or a Desktop path reference. A bare `/file` invocation shows the same restriction and keeps the draft without sending it. The composer captures the known selection when the user submits, including before slash-command lookup. If the selection changes before prompt admission, the composer keeps the draft and explains how to retry. Native command choices such as `/model` keep their normal handling.
